{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"3007e5aedfaa01e40b61e9670bcdeea8ba7c77b71087f4c3ae574490052b3b89"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:5af919151760c539cd1e4c3c1f17ffe5300f102832319bb8a5e0ccd6f3c82e5f","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Yes, John is patriotic.","evidence":"[D8:18 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] John: Wow, having symbols of travel memories in our homes is so cool! Last week I retook the aptitude test with some great results, and I feel drawn to serving my country in this way.\n[D8:20 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] John: Yeah, I chatted with my family and friends about it. They've been supportive and understand why I want to volunteer. I'm really proud to have this opportunity!","itemId":"urn:uuid:5728af97-f2ab-54e9-becf-d2b8ce468d1b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c4c980b829d934c8807fe59a9307adc61cc603ead4ea19e5fa965b2e0d7ecb7f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would John be considered a patriotic person?","referenceAnswer":"Yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c4c980b829d934c8807fe59a9307adc61cc603ead4ea19e5fa965b2e0d7ecb7f"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}